        "r": 550.6911552000005,
        "b": 755.6888826
      },
      "content": "20 seconds after the compressor stops, the up wind volume is weak (switching to SSLO in silent running mode) and then slightly weak. While the down wind volume is stoped"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0780",
      "reading_order": 1061,
      "section": "5.1.2.2 When the compressor stops and remains idle for 3 minutes",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 749.3838044,
        "r": 454.97727161999927,
        "b": 740.1310272000001
      },
      "content": "If the compressor stops when the heat running starts, the wind volume is weak"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0781",
      "reading_order": 1062,
      "section": "5.1.2.3 Dehumidification running",
      "bbox": {
