        "t": 687.1603152,
        "r": 450.203863050001,
        "b": 677.907538
      },
      "content": "Under the dehumidification mode the fan motor stops as the compressor stops"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0783",
      "reading_order": 1064,
      "section": "5.1.2.3 Dehumidification running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 671.6024598,
        "r": 323.4613255200003,
        "b": 662.3496826
      },
      "content": "The operation is weak after 3 minutes' idle mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0784",
