      "section": "5.1.2.3 Dehumidification running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 656.0446044,
        "r": 326.87832294999987,
        "b": 646.7918272000001
      },
      "content": "After stand by for 3 minutes, the compressor is on."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0785",
      "reading_order": 1066,
      "section": "5.1.2.3 Dehumidification running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 640.486749,
        "r": 550.6601914700002,
        "b": 615.6761164000001
      },
      "content": "The compressor operates as the set wind volume when the wind volume is set to be strong, medium or weak"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0786",
      "reading_order": 1067,
      "section": "5.1.2.3 Dehumidification running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 609.3710382,
        "r": 550.7321072299986,
        "b": 584.5604056000001
      },
      "content": "The wind volume is decided according to the temperature adjusting when the wind volume is set to be automatic."
    },
