        "b": 288.37079728749995
      },
      "content": "Tr ˘ 23 ć"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0792",
      "reading_order": 1074,
      "section": "5.1.2.4 Automatic running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.89300928999998,
        "t": 298.179085,
        "r": 285.82840761000017,
        "b": 288.9263078
      },
      "content": "Choose Heating Mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0793",
      "reading_order": 1075,
      "section": "5.1.2.4 Automatic running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.7670117,
        "t": 282.6811828,
        "r": 550.6861610499988,
        "b": 242.31269480000003
      },
      "content": "After turning to the automation mode, the running mode can be switched between cooling mode, fan mode  and  heating  mode  according  to  the  change  of  the  indoor  ambient  temperature.  But  the automatic conversion between cooling mode and heating mode must be conducted after 15 minutes."
    },
