        "r": 387.52927821000014,
        "b": 133.42538260000003
      },
      "content": "The running stops or ends the powerful running after 15 minutes"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0798",
      "reading_order": 1080,
      "section": "5.1.3.1 Powerful running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 127.12030440000001,
        "r": 297.4448005100007,
        "b": 117.86752720000004
      },
      "content": "The mode switch ends the powerful running"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0799",
      "reading_order": 1081,
      "section": "5.1.3.1 Powerful running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 111.56244900000002,
        "r": 550.5932698600002,
        "b": 86.75181640000005
      },
      "content": "Enter into the silent mode, normal running mode or timed switching on mode to end the powerful running"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0800",
      "reading_order": 1082,
      "section": "5.1.3.1 Powerful running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 80.44673820000003,
        "r": 550.6492043399993,
        "b": 71.19396100000006
      },
      "content": "When in automatic mode, there are powerful and silent functions for your choice. When the main unit is in cooling mode, it operates with powerful cooling or silent cooling. When the main unit is in heating mode, it operates with powerful heating or silent heating. When the main unit is in wind-sending mode, there are no powerful or silent modes."
    }
